#: scenario:scenario_ED60E24A_D5D2_4199_9D4A_E94A9D9B3689
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0eeda9ba7287cae15fac2f2866eb1290adfeba219c75d64b944e4a02ee77f41
#. default-sha256: a858599df87a670026a038929de5eae81716e1ef0728f991cd169ad6281dc56e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_ED60E24A_D5D2_4199_9D4A_E94A9D9B3689"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Master... ⟪k:7⟫What are your thoughts on the tale so far? ⟪k:8⟫"
"Which of the siblings do you think was in the right, Master—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫the brother, or the sister?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Maître... ⟪k:7⟫Que pensez-vous de ce conte, pour le moment ? "
"⟪k:8⟫Qui des deux enfants a raison, d’après vous—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫ le frère, ou la sœur ?"

#: scenario:scenario_E474E618_8ACA_4FF1_83AD_08FF723BF1FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83348f00e973de10058f71e65d01a9388761a5ee45d2ba2b663059da470378b2
#. default-sha256: 017e35f1a8f7df4ce0b873da75e59a257d8b70a4bb0b64d30781dbec92912e4b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E474E618_8ACA_4FF1_83AD_08FF723BF1FA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh my. I apologize for the abrupt question. ⟪k:1⟫Did I startle you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Oh ciel, désolée d’être si abrupte. ⟪k:1⟫Vous ai-je fait sursauter ?"

#: scenario:scenario_8D2A83F4_D871_40E8_A3C0_7ECBEE106D84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e54cb164295074f354e6f522782faa4a4bad70438f9edd76568593826b211017
#. default-sha256: e4ef3b1c140dab6ce5aae74e5823d1b066a404ef07c8295c4575dc6c9eed0a3e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8D2A83F4_D871_40E8_A3C0_7ECBEE106D84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What do I think? ⟪k:1⟫Hmm, yes, I believe Mell was probably right. ⟪k:2⟫He was also surely "
"happier than her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ce que j’en pense ? ⟪k:1⟫Humm, oui, je crois que Mell avait probablement raison. ⟪k:2⟫Il "
"était aussi beaucoup plus heureux qu’elle."

#: scenario:scenario_BD58283E_C541_4D18_BFD5_CEB565C496AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e858cbc214a22611435ee36a24562c2e9da4313ffc83879bb7739b56d158cb7
#. default-sha256: 338d1b689ea652bc0598737d1535433a22a7fe49631183de1244e772bc3ffe63
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BD58283E_C541_4D18_BFD5_CEB565C496AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As Mell had anticipated, Nellie fled from the theatre, leaving her fiancé behind."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Comme Mell l’avait prédit, Nellie s’était enfuie du théâtre, abandonnant là son fiancé."

#: scenario:scenario_840EC02B_37B4_4C56_AB9D_93EC372AEA6B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 825562db42a7cc23ee966d5bf901f8c4d9a637b83f80ce7cc60421c2c8f75be7
#. default-sha256: a82b15f0ddd28265f67931b950efc63565f997afc866b0994dbf9ebe0a59d91b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_840EC02B_37B4_4C56_AB9D_93EC372AEA6B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She forced her way into a carriage stopped outside—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫probably one called for a "
"different nobleman—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and ordered it to take her home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle s’était faufilée dans une calèche garée à l’extérieur —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ qui avait été appelée "
"pour un autre noble —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ et lui avait ordonné de la ramener chez elle."

#: scenario:scenario_20148EFC_D4CA_43E2_83EE_685EC497B0EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57e40b922d73cb6bba64ba5525f0ab68a9f57973726728c607e8ba185348229d
#. default-sha256: 59a8d828a53d583b3058a63ed354de81ca71e9880c7963b095c4e56e6f5f7b70
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20148EFC_D4CA_43E2_83EE_685EC497B0EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mell’s assumption was correct: the only place she had to return to was the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mell avait raison : le manoir était le seul endroit où elle pouvait retourner."

#: scenario:scenario_626B90C5_EA2A_46FA_856B_08250A0C7389
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b45bf89902f5e961d7c82eb9deef6c48f10839072174481ee0aef8d9d557bd0d
#. default-sha256: 76a83cf3f69efa6b4ebf00f2407419e17cc53078ff2b18593bba1fe0238ee61a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_626B90C5_EA2A_46FA_856B_08250A0C7389"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sun was beginning to set, and as a young lady, she could not simply go wandering through "
"town alone..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le soleil commençait à se coucher, et une jeune dame ne pouvait tout simplement pas aller se "
"promener en ville toute seule..."

#: scenario:scenario_0295D5D1_E317_4683_AD61_7F3D758B3BAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01ccd3f05b5dddbf737015cb97a27fc2dee9a736b34af23144fece92d6d9e77d
#. default-sha256: 9147aa65f70d1bcf75ee002559f43954e7836dbdb66d118a7453fae43a0221ad
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0295D5D1_E317_4683_AD61_7F3D758B3BAC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫nor did she have any acquaintances to take her in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫De plus, elle ne connaissait personne susceptible de l’accueillir."

#: scenario:scenario_587C9FC8_1040_46EF_B47A_57D5413ACBDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 117ec0bba9207209710e489bc936475ea3b8eb04718ad97f4b90cb1a6dbdb586
#. default-sha256: a8ed1bee2a44df8fdfcc4e6faba761b28a603d37eb2a1994604c35ca0a6639be
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_587C9FC8_1040_46EF_B47A_57D5413ACBDC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Her world was, in essence, composed of two elements: her brother and the rose garden. ⟪k:1⟫"
"They were the light of her life at Rose Manor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Son monde était essentiellement composé de deux éléments : son frère et le jardin de roses. "
"⟪k:1⟫Ils étaient la lumière de sa vie au manoir des Roses."

#: scenario:scenario_2FC3DD34_E481_4494_960C_D3D731B5A50D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3be631f52476c881c9be92130d2f92d563e3cd60586de46493d92c895f174374
#. default-sha256: 1af06ed0040ab0e4f5501f9657c212aa99f4cbf0e45c4efb5278963e9ff76822
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2FC3DD34_E481_4494_960C_D3D731B5A50D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫She lived a very... ⟪k:2⟫isolated existence."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Elle menait une vie... ⟪k:2⟫très isolée."

#: scenario:scenario_4DA89A01_3743_4A45_8132_C8AFB5DF153A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b15673b5a05742e0821c347988854d6a656b400a217482cb4d5e02e39f6af938
#. default-sha256: be3d10b1a69e6f1531613f39f6210623b83e7db3e6ada7370b68d103ddd6721a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4DA89A01_3743_4A45_8132_C8AFB5DF153A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫...⟪k:15⟫Haah... "
"⟪k:16⟫hahh!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫...⟪k:15⟫Haah... "
"⟪k:16⟫hahh !"

#: scenario:scenario_E911BDA9_03B0_4029_B41B_9AD978B127BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2cc47e4e8f1fe4e224b20f191df1f806e6f323917da3556c11ba8621706c2165
#. default-sha256: da24d2eaa233c1d438f3d06372cdfeb30685843e71bfb15e2e77b0f4115e2701
